{{Quote|Built for the skies, Angels possess greater jumping power and aerial mobility.}}
'''Angel'''  is one of the four [[races]] that players can spawn with upon joining the game for the first time. It has a 12.5% chance to be granted upon first joining. 

Angel largely relies on its potential to delay time in battles, providing the player with common abilities such as healing and improved jumping capabilities. The aforementioned buffs are considered by many to be easy to counter, but in return, its V4 can be effective against all races, not purely because of its powerful abilities, but thanks to the ability to break [[combos]], break [[Instinct]], and the huge damage it is capable of dealing.

In general, this race is particularly dangerous when [[Race Awakening|V4]] is activated, as it performs well against all races and playstyles. The V4 is considered one of the strongest races for PvP, boasting the highest damage per second among all races, while also being capable of breaking [[Instinct]] and stunning opponents while also being very good for grinding.

