==Overview==
<tabber>
Pros=
{{Overview|Pros
|'''General'''
* Great for sky camping. This is useful against some spammable fruits such as [[Dragon]] and [[Dough]].
* The higher initial [[Air Jump]] makes it possible in situations where hitting a move in the air is easier, (i.e; hitting [[Dough]] (Awakened or Non-Awakened) X or [[Lightning]] [X]) its possible without wasting a teleport move.
*Has insane damage and stuns while breaking instinct. This makes it able to counter every race and makes it one of the best races for PvP.

|'''[[Heavenly Blood]] (V3)'''
* Heals very fast, and can be used to regen during a move (such as [[Control]] V), unlike natural regen.
** Fast health and energy regeneration is useful for PvP and boss fights.
* Allows the user to out-heal one-shot combos.
* Good for drawing out long fights.
|'''Prince of the Skies (V4)'''
* Easier access to high locations such as [[Temple of Time]].
* Quite fast.
** Good for traveling.
** Can be used to escape combats.

|'''King's Rule (V4)'''
* High stun and damage.
** Can drain [[Portal]] users' energy quickly if they use [V] Dimensional Rift, making them unable to cast abilities and move quickly.
* Good for breaking enemies' combos, especially one-shot combos.
* [[Instinct/Break|Breaks Instinct]].
* Difficult to escape.
* Good defense.
* Great for farming, especially with M1s.
* One of the most powerful V4 abilities out of any V4
** Extremely effective in [[Raids]].
}}

|-|Cons=
{{Overview|Cons
|'''General'''
* [[Air Jump]] still costs [[energy]], although it is reduced.
* Jumping doesn't really help with moving/dodging, which is important in PvP.

|'''[[Heavenly Blood]] (V3)'''
* Instead of healing immediately, it heals over time.
* Weak defense.
* No damage or movement buffs.

|'''Prince of the Skies (V4)'''
* Doesn't give advantages in PvP. (Although it can aid in running away)
* Cannot be used with nearly all [[Beast]] transformations. (Including [[Gas]])

|'''King's Rule (V4)'''
* Short range.
* Doesn't completely stun neither [[Bosses]], nor players.
* May mess up some combos while in the air due to its tendency to stun enemies towards the ground.
}}
</tabber>

==Tips & Tricks==
* [[Flash Step]] and any other moves can be used in mid-air while flying with the "Prince of the Skies" V4 gear.

==Trivia==
* Unawakened [[Buddha]]'s transformation can turn the wings into golden wings. (Although they cannot be used with '''Prince of the Skies'''.)
* The '''Prince of the Skies''' gear is disabled while any [[transformation]] is active (except [[Dragon]]’s Hybrid form).
* If the user activates Angel V3 while standing inside Ghoul V4 domain, the healing will remain 1/sec.
* While the user has '''V4''' on, they can stand on lava, since the idle animation is technically '''off-ground.'''
* This race's '''V4''' is arguably one of the best '''V4''' for PvP, mostly due to the '''King's Rule''' ability.
* When the user activates '''V4''' and stands near another player, that victim's colours become black‑and‑white, creating a fully desaturated, inverted visual effect on their screen.
* Interestingly, if the user equips [[Eagle]] and goes '''V4''', their Angel wings disappear and are replaced with [[Eagle]]'s wings and have the exact same animation when flying/hovering (though rarely it doesn’t get replaced).
* The tier 2 '''King's Rule''' ability does about 2500 damage per second.

